  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge transfer from the Red Cross Centre for  Tortured Refugees to the Human - Knowledge transfer from the Red Cross Centre for</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring fr&#xe5;n R&#xf6;da Korsets Center f&#xf6;r   Torterade Flyktingar till Huma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of the intervention is to facilitate knowledge sharing between HRFT and RCC in the form of one exchange visit from RCC to HRFT and another one from HRFT to RCC per year so that both organizations are up to date about techniques on rehabilitation of torture survivors.

RCC has an objective to support HRFT in their long term objective to offer torture survivors competent treatment and rehabilitation to achieve a state of complete physical, psychological and social well being. RCC will offer consultations in specific treatment methods.

RCC will provide lectures, work shops and joint discussions. HRFT will invite other key actors working with torture survivors and/or refugees as part of the exchange meetings.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of HRFT&apos;s programme in Turkey thw RCC shall transfer          knowledge to the organization as well as support the development of   new methodologies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

RKC skall i linje med bifogad ans&#xf6;kan inom tre omr&#xe5;den st&#xf6;dja HRFT i att uppn&#xe5; sina m&#xe5;l enligt stratgisk plan som ligger till grund f&#xf6;r Sida:s k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationen, presenterade i HRFT:s resultatmatris.

F&#xf6;r det f&#xf6;rsta kommer RGC konsulteras i utveckling av HRFT:s metoder inom kognitiv beteende-terap (KBT) och psykodynamisk terapi, psycho-educational interventions, gruppm&#xf6;ten med m&#xf6;draroch barn f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga andra-generationens traumatisering samt gruppsamtal med medisinsk yoga.

F&#xf6;r det andra kommer RKC och HRFT att organisera gruppm&#xf6;ten och utbyte av erfarenheter camt behandlin med fokus p&#xe5; presentationer av nya metoder och framg&#xe5;ngsrika tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt inom dessa omr&#xe5;den. 

F&#xf6;r det tredje kommer individuella m&#xf6;ten mellan kolleger med sammayrkesm&#xe4;ssiga och teoretiska bakgrund organiseras.</narrative>
  </description>
